@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = COLE_UM_ACCESS_TOKEN_VALIDO_APENAS_NO_SEU_CLIENTE_HTTP
@marketId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID_RETORNADO
@productId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID_RETORNADO

### Categorias (publico)
GET {{base}}/categories

### Mercados (publico)
GET {{base}}/markets?limit=50&offset=0

### Ofertas (publico)
GET {{base}}/products

### Busca (publico)
GET {{base}}/products/search?q=iogurte&category=laticinios

### Produtos de um mercado
GET {{base}}/markets/{{marketId}}/products

### Cadastrar o proprio mercado
POST {{base}}/owner/market
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marketName": "Meu Mercado",
  "marketPhone": "11999999999",
  "document": "12345678000190",
  "postalCode": "01001000",
  "state": "SP",
  "city": "São Paulo",
  "neighborhood": "Centro",
  "address": "Rua Exemplo",
  "addressNumber": "100",
  "complement": "",
  "name": "Nome",
  "lastName": "Sobrenome",
  "username": "meumercado",
  "email": "responsavel@example.com",
  "phone": "11999999999",
  "referralSource": ""
}

### Ler meu mercado
GET {{base}}/owner/market
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar produto: ajuste as datas para o dia do teste
POST {{base}}/owner/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Iogurte natural",
  "categoryId": "laticinios",
  "manufactureDate": "2026-10-10",
  "expirationDate": "2026-10-20",
  "originalPrice": 10.00,
  "offerPrice": 7.50,
  "stockQuantity": 8
}

### Listar meus produtos
GET {{base}}/owner/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar produto
PUT {{base}}/owner/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Iogurte natural",
  "categoryId": "laticinios",
  "manufactureDate": "2026-10-10",
  "expirationDate": "2026-10-20",
  "originalPrice": 10.00,
  "offerPrice": 6.50,
  "stockQuantity": 5
}

### Desativar oferta
PATCH {{base}}/owner/products/{{productId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"isActive": false}

### Horarios completos
PUT {{base}}/owner/market/hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"days":[
  {"day":0,"enabled":false,"periods":[]},
  {"day":1,"enabled":true,"periods":[{"opensAt":"08:00","closesAt":"12:00"},{"opensAt":"13:00","closesAt":"18:00"}]},
  {"day":2,"enabled":false,"periods":[]},
  {"day":3,"enabled":false,"periods":[]},
  {"day":4,"enabled":false,"periods":[]},
  {"day":5,"enabled":false,"periods":[]},
  {"day":6,"enabled":false,"periods":[]}
]}

### Excluir produto
DELETE {{base}}/owner/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enviar/substituir foto do próprio mercado (até 5 MB; ajuste o caminho)
PUT {{base}}/owner/market/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ecofood-market-photo

--ecofood-market-photo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mercado.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./mercado.jpg
--ecofood-market-photo--

### Foto pública atual (imageUri da resposta contém a versão para invalidar cache)
GET {{base}}/markets/{{marketId}}/image

### Enviar foto (troque o caminho local antes de executar)
PUT {{base}}/owner/products/{{productId}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ecofood-photo

--ecofood-photo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="produto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./produto.jpg
--ecofood-photo--
